    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302680</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_000&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうしてだよ！
バジルさん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mister Basil, please! Please tell
me why you're doing this!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302680</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔法で世界の人、
救うんじゃなかったのか！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I thought you were going to
use magic to help people!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302988</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_002Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>救いたかったのは、
世界なんてものじゃない、
&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ&lt;White&gt;の人たちだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I never wanted to help this world! I only
wanted to help the people of &lt;Red&gt;Valhalla&lt;White&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302988</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_003Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、アルヴァニスタは、
人工マナの材料である
『紅の月』の情報を流して</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But, Alvanista had to interfere. They leaked my
reasearch on artificial Mana to the "Red Moon."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302988</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_004Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>金目当ての採掘者どもをあおり、
結果、採掘者と住民との間の
衝突を看過した！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They contracted many miners to harvest materials.
The result? A conflict arose between the miners and
the citizens. One conflict they completely overlooked.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303104</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>で、&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ&lt;White&gt;の連中は、
採掘者たちに
街を追い出された……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Then &lt;Red&gt;Valhalla&lt;White&gt;'s folks got kicked out
of their own city by the miners...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303276</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_006Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうだ……
何人も寒さや飢えで
死んだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Correct. Many people were
killed for stupid reasons.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303276</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_007Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アルヴァニスタは
何もしてくれなかった……
見殺しにしたのさ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Meanwhile, Alvanista did absolutely nothing...
Nothing but watch people suffer!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303428</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だから、
無差別に人殺しする
連中の力借りんのか！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So in return, the citizens thought
indiscriminately killing people was
the answer!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303428</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんな
ヒドイ奴らの力を……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is a horrible power...!
This isn't what you wanted!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303596</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_010Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>使えるヤツらなら、
それがどんなヤツだろうと
関係ない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If it helps the people from Valhalla, then
I don't care what happens to anyone else.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303596</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_011Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔科学と引き換えに
あの村を守れるんなら！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I must replace Magitechnology
to protect the village!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303664</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔科学を……！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Magitechnology, you say!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303856</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ……そんなんで、
全部自分の夢、
台無しにしちまうのかよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why...? Then everything you
told me was a lie? All my
dreams are worthless, then...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303856</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なぁっ！　夢は思い続けないと
叶わないって言ったよな！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>WHY!? Didn't you say dreams won't come
true unless we see them through to the end!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_015Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>その僕の夢がみんなを、
あの村をメチャクチャに
したんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Everyone said my dream to help
the village was a pipe dream...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_016Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もういい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And you know what...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304116</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_017Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>夢なんて、思い続けてたって
叶いやしない……
叶うわけがない！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They were right! No matter how hard
you try...dreams never come true!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304344</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ウソだよ……どうして、
そんなこと言うんだよ……
バジルさん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're joking, right? This isn't funny...
Why are you saying this, Mister Basil?
This isn't who you are, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304228</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_018Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>僕が君に言った
なんにでもなれるなんて話は、
妄想なんだよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What I've told you back then,
all that talk about dreams...
was complete bullshit!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304576</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_022Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うわぁあっ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Argh!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304644</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>バジルさん！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No! Mister Basil!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304716</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ご苦労さん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nicely done, human.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304848</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まったく、つまらん禁呪文で
オイラたちを操ろうなんて、
とんでもねぇ男だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Did this man truly think he could control
us with such pathetic Demonic Manipulation
skills...? How foolish.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304936</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おまえは……
グレムリンレアー……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You are...Gremlin's Lair!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305068</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おや、誰かと思えば、
前にオイラ騙して、無理矢理
契約させた奴じゃないの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh? A familiar face. Move aside.
You aren't with the summoner
capable of making impossible pacts.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305172</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_028Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>な、なぜだ……
なぜ僕の魔操術が……
効かない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-Why isn't my magic working on you...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305360</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_029&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あんたのそれ通用すんの
下っ端の魔族だけだよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do you think you managed to come
this far solely due to your magic?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305360</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔界の王プルート様も
感謝してるぜ。
魔界の門を開いてくれてさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You should be thanking Lord of Daemonium,
Pluto, for this feat. We've been just using
you to open the door.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305432</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_031Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うわぁああっ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>uwahhh!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305532</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_032&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>バジルさんを……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let go...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305532</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_033&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……はなせ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>OF MR. BASIL!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305652</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_160_040_034&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オイラとやるってかい？
いいよ、相手になろう
じゃないの！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do you wish to fight? All
right, I'll shred you to pieces!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
